<<Comment: Rest in a squeeze may yield more ticks before shelter beliefs match reality (LoS limits for predator and prey) — tune in playtest after weights resolve.>>

**Resolved — believed safe location unknown:** Set finding location as objective (§2); do not emit `STAY` or `REST` until at a candidate site.

